WEBVTT

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.100
Something is coming.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.200
Something hungry for blood.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.300
What is it?

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.800
See you tomorrow.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.300
Good night, ladies. Kiss your mom good night for me.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.900
Will is missing. I don't know where he is.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:48.100
99 out of 100 times a kid goes missing, the kid is with a parent or relative.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:49.500
What about the other time?

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:50.400
What?

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:52.900
You said 99 out of 100.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.300
What about the other time?

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.900
The one.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.200
I really think we should turn back.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:05.100
Did you guys hear that?

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:10.600
That's not Will.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:15.300
You're in trouble, aren't you?

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:20.000
We've sealed off this area.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:21.800
Is this where it came from?

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:22.900
Yes.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:24.400
And the girl?

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:26.600
She can't have gone far.

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:28.500
Find her.

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:31.600
Do you really think it was a coincidence that we found her?

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:33.100
The same place where Will disappeared?

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:36.400
Something is going on here.

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:48.600
Is there any way that you could reach him?

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:49.500
Yes.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.200
What if this whole time I've been looking for Will,

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:00.100
I've been chasing after something else?
